
crypto isakmp policy {{IKE_policy_number}}
encr aes 256
hash sha256
authentication pre-share
group 14
lifetime 7200

crypto isakmp key strongkey! address 0.0.0.0  

crypto ipsec transform-set crypt-ts esp-aes 256 esp-sha256-hmac 
 mode transport

crypto ipsec profile crypt-profile
 set transform-set crypt-ts 

int range tun0, tun1
tunnel protection ipsec profile crypt-profile shared